	(gr_text "This is a 'panelized' board, to be sent to OSH Park.\nThe interior edge cuts will be made except that the \ntwo boards will be joined by a single tab with 'mouse\nbite' holes. The two boards are separated by a 0.1{dblquote}\nboundary and the set of baords is withing a 0.2{dblquote} frame.\n"
